@startuml seq-user-payment
!theme plain
title ParkEase BD: UML Sequence Diagram - How a User Pays for a Booking

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  ParticipantBorderColor #E65100
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  ActorBorderColor #2E7D32
  LifeLineBorderColor #9E9E9E
}
autonumber

actor User
participant "Web App\n(Next.js)" as Web
participant "ParkEase API\n(Express)" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n(bookings, payments,\nledger, wallets)" as DB
participant "SSLCOMMERZ\n(gateway)" as SSL

User -> Web : Open booking, press\n"Pay Tk X with SSLCOMMERZ"
Web -> API : POST create checkout session (bookingId)
API -> DB : Load booking total (paisa) and\nUser's Refund Balance
API -> API : Split total: part from Refund Balance,\nrest via gateway (gateway part >= Tk 10)
API -> DB : Create Payment + PaymentAttempt,\nhold the Refund Balance part
alt Whole amount covered by Refund Balance
  API -> DB : Capture immediately (no gateway)
else Gateway amount > 0
  API -> SSL : Create hosted session (amount BDT,\ntran_id, success/fail/cancel/IPN URLs)
  SSL --> API : GatewayPageURL
  API --> Web : GatewayPageURL
  Web -> SSL : Redirect User to hosted checkout
  User -> SSL : Pay by card, bKash, Nagad,\nor net banking
  SSL -> API : IPN / success callback (tran_id, val_id)
  API -> SSL : Validation API (val_id)
  SSL --> API : VALID, amount, currency, risk
  API -> API : Match tran_id, amount, currency,\nbooking and payment state
end
group One serializable DB transaction
  API -> DB : Ledger: DEBIT External Payment Clearing\n(+ User Refund Balance used),\nCREDIT Booking Held Funds (full total)
  API -> DB : Credit Provider share to Provider\nwallet **pending** balance
  API -> DB : Payment SUCCEEDED,\nbooking CONFIRMED
  API -> DB : Create the QR access credential
end
SSL -> Web : Redirect back to /driver/payments/return
Web -> API : Get payment status
API --> Web : SUCCEEDED
Web --> User : "Payment confirmed" + gate QR pass

note over API, SSL
  The browser redirect is only navigation.
  A booking is confirmed only after the
  server-side validation call succeeds, and a
  repeated IPN cannot confirm it twice.
end note

@enduml
